{"id":318,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为弘扬五四精神，表彰先进典型，进一步加强学院学风建设，引导广大团员青年以昂扬向上的姿态投身学习与实践中，机电工程学院于2026年5月12日17:30在老干部活动中心召开纪念五四运动107周年表彰大会暨学风建设动员大会。学院在校院领导、各科室负责人、全体辅导员及获奖代表出席本次会议。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3LNCBiLNQkL8Q2UG4-YLNQknm-YM4-fsMlWfnzLsMmN4UmL0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2LSysM1yYU4MkMzNinN-iMlrfLmlZMm-boR9inRQ2LlrFLRlboRMVMm6FMzf2ozLJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0Lz9sLmUJqdknx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0F1762C3B595FB55EA258629885D6F1E/05983E67/50F93\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3LmWBRU4lDLRLsMGzGsUm7ZUmAfU4nfRUznkM4Nao7liLm-0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiMYy4LSh7n7CPL4V2nRffLRU8LRWkLNl4U46fMlMfnmVFL4vYoR6kMlVFM87aU4v4gtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47ZM4-8gtA8pUkcc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\"></p><p>会议在全体参会人员齐唱国歌的庄严氛围中拉开帷幕。随后，机电工程学院党委副书记田海燕宣读表彰决定，对过去一年在共青团工作、学风建设等方面表现突出的先进集体与优秀个人予以表彰，号召全院师生以先进为榜样，传递榜样力量。</p><p>本次表彰共设置6组奖项，与会领导依次为获奖代表颁发荣誉证书与纪念品。一张张证书承载着奋斗的汗水，一份份荣誉彰显着青春的担当，台下热烈的掌声既是对获奖者的祝贺，更是对全院青年奋勇争先的激励。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3Ll-BYLRGbnNUbLGmMkozV7LR-iUmrfVM4VkLzCaUmA2U8L0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyanSh7USysn7CDM7MknNM2oz9ZLzvZUzl8LN7DMRLbnR6FUl7Dn7U8ozWFM7QVoR9Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0Lz9sLmUJqdknx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C0EDA7DF64CBFCF988178A542A6439D7/AA6DD492/4FE88\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3LlVBfMNUZozVkLGNn2LRVkLlU4LlQffnlUaLzNDM4liL770gihFp2hmCIa0MSyZLkyYM1yDUl78MmlanmV2Mlr2M4NYUNW2nRUDUNr7L8nFMmv4U8LaM4nFnzvaLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47ZM4-8gtA8pUkcc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\"></p><p>颁奖仪式后，3名获奖代表依次上台发言。他们结合自身学习、工作经历，分享了在专业学习、社会实践、班级建设等方面的经验与感悟，展现了机电学子勤奋笃学、勇担使命的精神风貌，也为在场同学树立了可学可做的榜样。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3nRTBkLR9sM8Q7MGmTRMRv8L8C8o7nfkL7Q7Umn7M8CPUmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyaMYh2MSyYoRQfU87iLl-bnRAkMlWRU4V7UmfVoRV2MmAFnRVfLz7ZMRnFLNCaMm9Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0Lz9sLmUJqdknx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/107F5286ACA51B9D8B5BCC1DB0E81F68/D1A11844/2F068\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3Uz9BZM8-8nmN8nGzQkozGsMRWRM4nfko7lbU4liMmGYLzL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y8MYhVnkyiL7MVMmvaU4CYnmN8LlV7MRA2nRliMzrVnzTFMzAVMmUPnR6FMmvDLzlZgtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47ZM4-8gtA8pUkcc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3M4NBZU4W7nl-snGRr2nR-PU4-aozMffnlWVoRr7n7VkLRU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkybMSyboSyDo7liLm74UzfkoRTfoRVkLNrfnR98MRv8MNMFL4CaM7rkLmQFLNMRL7-Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0Lz9sLmUJqdknx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0959968E5213A0B89A81B2EAD844746C/3604EB26/2CC0B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3oRrBfnlLiUNQRUGzrRUzARL4A7oRUfYnR-iLm78nRlZLm70gihFp2hmCIa0okyaUYh7MkhRozf2M4lbUzA7nmVVLRlinlW2olUaMzvPU46Fo7liL8Q2UzWFMNliM8V2gtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47ZM4-8gtA8pUkcc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3Lz9BaL4-DolW7MGm62UmvDnRvZL4nffo7LioRW7nRLsM8U0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yaMkhfUSyiLzv4ozV2M8nfMzLDnmGZMNUPnRMRoz9sL7rFLmWVUNMkLzQFLm6RMNUJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0Lz9sLmUJqdknx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/604AA517391F7DA536F086D1D3C9870E/22EBCB16/27C6D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3MlLBPozQ2UlLYoGR9DMlCPnRQVMRWf7U4Q7ozn2LN74M8C0gihFp2hmCIa0U1ybMkhVMkysM7U8nmGZUzARL4-snN-snR-bMmQRMmNPLlVFn77YoRWfLRTFMNVfU4rkgtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47ZM4-8gtA8pUkcc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\"></p><p>机电工程学院院长李强作总结讲话。他首先向受到表彰的先进集体和个人表示热烈祝贺，向为学院发展辛勤付出的全体师生表示诚挚感谢。同时，围绕学风建设提出明确要求，强调优良学风是学院发展的根基，更是青年成长的保障，号召全院同学以本次大会为契机，坚定理想信念，厚植家国情怀，锤炼过硬本领，以勤勉务实的态度投入学习，以锐意进取的精神投身实践，努力在专业领域深耕细作，在国防军工等祖国需要的领域建功立业，书写无愧于时代的青春篇章。<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3MzVBVn7nkLRVVoGRvYn7LaozNaMl-fbU4GPM4G4Lm98Um90gihFp2hmCIa0MYy8USyboSyaMmCsM7-inmv8Lm-iM4LPMm-YMNQfLz98UNQFMmvbnzvPoRVFM7CaolCJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0Lz9sLmUJqdknx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/74A9906674B5F742257316226FA184BF/679E7181/4F09F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3LNnBkLl7iUmTRnGmrfUNrkLlWkU8CfYMm7anllZol7bU4C0gihFp2hmCIa0nky8okyYL1hfM7W7M4-PUlM2Uz67L4-DUzU8L8UiMRvZnmMFLlWRUNrRMRWFL4lYMzLagtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47ZM4-8gtA8pUkcc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次大会既是一次表彰先进、树立榜样的总结会，也是一次弘扬五四精神、推进学风建设的动员会。相信机电工程学院全体师生将以此次大会为新起点，以先进为标杆，以奋斗为底色，传承五四薪火，涵养优良学风，以更加饱满的热情、更加昂扬的斗志，在新时代的征程上勇毅前行，共同推动学院各项工作再上新台阶！</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3L7UB8L4GbLRUbUG47soRGYL4f7L4Cf8MRUbUN-DolCsL4C0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hRn1hfM1ybo7LYUzrfnmVRMllDLRCYo7LDUzMVnmNDo7QFM4G4L8-bLzWFMmlanNlJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0Lz9sLmUJqdknx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6CFA698C2A5AF1C5E60628C6A3EF968F/7033B912/650FE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3nmfBVozGDn7-bLGmAknRLZMzM2LR6f7M8-ZnNlZoR7Dn770gihFp2hmCIa0USybLSy4n1hRLmf7MNlYMRN4oRnknm9aU4A7Lm78nmUiLmrFLRLsnzQkM4fFnNlZLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47ZM4-8gtA8pUkcc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg\"></p><p>图：王佳瑞、陶柳杏、陆城汉</p><p>文：王佳瑞</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jdgc.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3LNCBiLNQkL8Q2UG4-YLNQknm-YM4-fsMlWfnzLsMmN4UmL0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2LSysM1yYU4MkMzNinN-iMlrfLmlZMm-boR9inRQ2LlrFLRlboRMVMm6FMzf2ozLJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0Lz9sLmUJqdknx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=18724&e=.jpg"}